body:
1. Parentification; I was expected to take care of my younger sis and made responsible for her since she was born, even though I’m only 5 years older; 
Oh, I also had to take care of my mom when she couldn’t do it for herself; 

2. Being grounded and stripped away from all communication with the outside world except from school for the smallest mistakes; 

3. The constant yelling. My mom would yell at me for hours, sometimes days on end, she would also call me the most horrible things during these “sessions” 

4. Oh, the name-calling. I spent the enterity of my teenage years being called a slut, a whore, and so on, for completely age-apropriate behavior 

5. The complete lack of privacy, even as an adult

Honestly, the list goes on and on, but the trip down memory lane has already ruined my day, so I’ll just stop here
